{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c06f512b6521a611869458cc4df6957b1d02fa716d3e8445e283c76cef0c948e", "ja": "（麗花と志保は今度のデュオ公演の取材中だ。あと\n10分ほどで休憩の時間だから、何か茶菓子でも……）", "zh": "（丽花和志保正在为即将举行的双人公演接受采访。再过\n大约10分钟就到休息时间了，要不要准备点茶点……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1001_p", "source_sha256": "26cecea24d0041ac229b0203642366f6360940b190efb0606e6bce022cca705b", "ja": "（ん？　見慣れないティーカップが置いてあるな。\nじゃあ、これを使って……）", "zh": "（嗯？这里放着一个没见过的茶杯。那就用这个吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "a5836dcefa49e46510956170b6c3e20d4cfc69819b9999d530f5d04673f36645", "ja": "わぁ、やっぱり紅茶にはケーキですよね♪\n{$P$}さん、さすがです！", "zh": "哇，红茶果然还是得配蛋糕呢♪\n{$P$}先生，真不愧是您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1003_p", "source_sha256": "76cb813774f0fa33df61c2fd7f27ec22de834bca2db3735fd00cf3063b2c1c07", "ja": "あれ、麗花？\nもう休憩に入ったのか？", "zh": "哎，丽花？\n已经开始休息了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "2dfda70aa91114cfd5ed61be8490c08b1dad6b88db93bb9277c8076d270aab22", "ja": "はい、取材が順調に進みましたから。\n志保ちゃんにも褒めてもらいました♪", "zh": "是的，因为采访进行得很顺利。志保也夸我了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "56b7177a09584c9d89026143cd3cd5abeba02df4988ff8eba32a7e6aea7eea24", "ja": "「いつもの麗花さんでしたけど、今日はお話に\nついていきやすくて助かりました」って！", "zh": "她说「虽然和平常的丽花小姐一样，但今天的谈话\n比较容易跟得上，帮大忙了」！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2ced9e4be8777f38cece89cc271365cbaee567678ed00e6e48ede0e94d7781e6", "ja": "それはよかった……のかな？\nまぁ、それだけお互いの理解が深まってるってことか。", "zh": "那就好……吧？\n不过，这也说明我们彼此更加了解了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "8d44131db0abd66246b72c2c5fb25aa5d7971ef19cec767b8f453ff62d165114", "ja": "ふふっ、志保ちゃんと私の普通が入れ替わったおかげ\nですね！　……あ、だからこれも思いついたのかも？", "zh": "呵呵，多亏志保和我的日常互换了呢！……啊，说不定也是因为这样，我才想到了这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c935cc910c82ea47e59f4de9880e2c0c18b6c7b7417ddb33df8058228b292b57", "ja": "これ、というと？", "zh": "你说的这个，是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "ff92e90ba91b8a2c1e2f294352b2a3d3ec7d5dbbe8e22d8cf40e15eca27f221c", "ja": "{$P$}さんは何だと思いますか？\nヒントは、もう答えが出ています！", "zh": "你觉得{$P$}先生是什么？\n提示是，答案已经出现了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e5d651136f41efb9551779ee554234a7cb0ab964ecb8be142b042316209cb513", "ja": "む、難しいな……。\nえっと、お茶を淹れる？", "zh": "嗯，有点难啊……\n那个，要泡茶吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "5e591fe8fba804144e2d4adcaace89d760f0c020d1afd14d75243c92ea13777a", "ja": "惜しい！　正解は「取材で撮ってもらう小道具として\n新しい紅茶とティーカップを用意する」でした～！", "zh": "可惜！正确答案是“准备新的红茶和茶杯，作为采访时请人拍摄的小道具”～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "c8f6087ddc0ae700f3b04ce35981a0227483f67539cdf7755d6e9311d82218da", "ja": "じつはこのティーカップもお茶も、私と志保ちゃんが\n一緒に選んだこだわりの品なんですよ♪", "zh": "其实，这套茶杯和茶叶也是我和志保一起精心挑选的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1013_p", "source_sha256": "40c5da491ad301ef7a6c7a89e99b7d9b9d2ec2b71d8fcf1d594ce6f5de36fa47", "ja": "あ、これ今日の取材のためのものだったのか。\nそういえば、衣装にもピッタリだ……。", "zh": "啊，原来这是为了今天的采访准备的啊。\n这么一想，和服装也很相配……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "990fafe1e8627813d5b8871a7787802b1e8e9cb2bf50da1a8e9520143d21fadf", "ja": "ニアピン賞として、{$P$}さんにも\n志保ちゃんと選んだお茶っ葉をわけてあげますね。", "zh": "作为近洞奖，也给{$P$}先生分一些我和志保选的茶叶吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "895cc072d4352722d48507d2797b2ab3fb39bf31600764ea2df943f395117852", "ja": "とってもおいしいので、\nケーキと一緒に飲んでみてください♪", "zh": "很好喝的，配着蛋糕一起喝喝看吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d676805e7791d904eb8a1bf86023bc55fa6255c38de0400228d1057ccd553f56", "ja": "ありがとう。じゃあせっかくだし、麗花たちの分と\n一緒に淹れさせてもらうよ。", "zh": "谢谢。那正好，我就连同丽花她们的份一起泡了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0593_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "bf372f2a030f043873fbc2c5d4d41aabd3564d9fa38664b4b439a0f1acd2da9a", "ja": "ふふっ、3人で一緒にティーパーティーですね♪\n{$P$}さんのケーキ姿も楽しみです！", "zh": "呵呵，和3人一起举办茶会呢♪  \n也很期待看看{$P$}先生的蛋糕装扮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
